{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aHeroes Of Isekai\u300bis a roguelike auto-battler where you choose a hero, build an army, and strategize for battle. Develop your hero, manage a town, allocate resources, upgrade units, and recruit diverse races. Each hero has unique lore, skills, and talents, offering distinct strategic gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Hero</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/52c4aa2d2830a58c5435919a29cc9851.poster.avif?t=1770348351\" width=650 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/52c4aa2d2830a58c5435919a29cc9851.webm?t=1770348351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/52c4aa2d2830a58c5435919a29cc9851.mp4?t=1770348351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We offer a variety of heroes, each with unique skills that drastically alter gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Races &amp; Units</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/dc49c434ae24c9b4cc52b59a5e322bd1.avif?t=1770348351\" width=650 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slimes, Goblins, Beasts, and more...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Camp - Purchase &amp; Build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/2395de884607a89b8f625c6f91b037fb.poster.avif?t=1770348351\" width=650 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/2395de884607a89b8f625c6f91b037fb.webm?t=1770348351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/2395de884607a89b8f625c6f91b037fb.mp4?t=1770348351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized pools offer buildings, spells, runes, and units. Spend gold each round to shape your hero and army\u2014choose your path.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Buildings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/07f77a22a48c4661e36bf7688fbd3044.poster.avif?t=1770348351\" width=650 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/07f77a22a48c4661e36bf7688fbd3044.webm?t=1770348351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/07f77a22a48c4661e36bf7688fbd3044.mp4?t=1770348351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Structures with special effects: amplify magic, forge hero gear, enhance unit stats, and more...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Magic System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend mana to cast spells\u2014water, fire, earth, or wind, tiered from basic to advanced. Unleash lightning strikes, empower troops, or freeze enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hero Equipment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/03944827312f02c9c169ad729e8e9aea.avif?t=1770348351\" width=650 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up to boost stats\u2014time to go god-mode.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rune System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/75b56fabd4b45b8efee4a535a069e09f.avif?t=1770348351\" width=650 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip runes for multi-dimensional upgrades, a core build mechanic. Some grant instant bonuses; powerful ones require conditions to activate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hero Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/2429407ad03f005bcd2444535c7dae30.poster.avif?t=1770348351\" width=650 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/2429407ad03f005bcd2444535c7dae30.webm?t=1770348351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/2429407ad03f005bcd2444535c7dae30.mp4?t=1770348351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three core paths:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Army:</strong> Invest in units and runes. Hero talents/passives buff your forces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magic:</strong> Focus on spell-related buildings, runes, and gear. Talents amplify magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legend:</strong> Pour gold into smithing and power runes. Craft epic gear\u2014hero skills supercharge it.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Perilous Maps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/01ff0f237dc4915a7387607fb5b7b9fd.poster.avif?t=1770348351\" width=650 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/01ff0f237dc4915a7387607fb5b7b9fd.webm?t=1770348351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/01ff0f237dc4915a7387607fb5b7b9fd.mp4?t=1770348351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick 1 of 3 nodes per move. Weigh risks vs rewards\u2014deeper zones bring tougher foes but greater loot. Push forward... until you face the Abyss Legion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Extensive Meta Totem Collection</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/c7ff66333d46d52681db31c0f80c7c9d.poster.avif?t=1770348351\" width=650 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/c7ff66333d46d52681db31c0f80c7c9d.webm?t=1770348351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/c7ff66333d46d52681db31c0f80c7c9d.mp4?t=1770348351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete area explorations to earn totems. These aren't just decorations\u2014they grant powerful permanent buffs to strengthen your capabilities. Equip multiple totems before each run based on your meta points.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meta Town Hub</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/3fef05d99c51a9b42732a20c7c82c57b.poster.avif?t=1770348351\" width=650 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/3fef05d99c51a9b42732a20c7c82c57b.webm?t=1770348351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/3fef05d99c51a9b42732a20c7c82c57b.mp4?t=1770348351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Your base of operations. Unlock new gameplay modes and permanent abilities here.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2676290?t=1770348351","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2676290?t=1770348351","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/d843232c9ff1e94952cd4bde0bd5ff69bad39a36/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770348351","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/d843232c9ff1e94952cd4bde0bd5ff69bad39a36/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770348351","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aHeroes Of Isekai\u300bis a roguelike auto-battler where you choose a hero, build an army, and strategize for battle. Develop your hero, manage a town, allocate resources, upgrade units, and recruit diverse races. Each hero has unique lore, skills, and talents, offering distinct strategic gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Hero</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/52c4aa2d2830a58c5435919a29cc9851.poster.avif?t=1770348351\" width=650 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/52c4aa2d2830a58c5435919a29cc9851.webm?t=1770348351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\">